      "eventDescription": "GENESIS signifies the beginning of a new journey. It represents the transition of leadership, the unveiling of a new vision and mission, and the start of another year focused on innovation, technology, and community-driven development,\nThe first 2 days will focus on student impact initiatives for second-year students, aimed at\nencouraging the engineering mentality, innovation, and practical learning. These sessions will help students understand real-world development approaches, explore opportunities within the technology\necosystem,\nand motivate them to build solutions beyond classroom learning,\nThe third day of GENESIS will consist of the GDSC Council Induction & Vision Ceremony. The ceremony will begin with an interactive session by a speaker from the official GDG community, providing students with insights into the Google Developer Groups ecosystem, upcoming opportunities, community initiatives, and the role of GDG in fostering innovation and collaboration.",
